    {
      "id": "page-01",
      "file": "page-01.mp3",
      "text": "Maya's first morning at the local news channel began with a surprise. An overnight storm had damaged the old bridge. Her editor handed her a microphone and a notebook. 'Show our viewers what happened, and check every detail,' he said. At the river, engineers were already repairing the broken railing. Maya took her first photograph. Her first report was beginning, but she did not yet know whose lives it would change.",
      "kind": "section",
      "bytes": 399194,
      "sha256": "84660c98048cc2eb492204bc704a5fccc0e6652f9347ba574991a37580551077"
    },
