    },
    {
      "id": "page-03",
      "file": "page-03.mp3",
      "text": "At home, a family paid close attention to a battery radio. The official instructions explained which streets were closed. Near Mr Reed's house, a firefighter raised one hand. Everyone became quiet. He turned his head towards an upstairs window, hoping to detect a faint voice. Maya stayed on the dry lane. She could see a curtain move, but she could not tell whether anyone was behind it.",
      "kind": "section",
      "bytes": 382893,
      "sha256": "566eae6af1f5135332b0a50c35ed3cdfeb55775a9eb9693a8aa63678b768a21f"
    },
    {
      "id": "prediction-03",
      "file": "prediction-03.mp3",
      "text": "What could the moving curtain mean? Suggest two possibilities.",
