    {
      "id": "page-04",
      "file": "page-04.mp3",
      "text": "The rescue boat moved slowly between the houses. The crew searched each window for a sign of the missing neighbour. At the command post, two rescuers studied a map to choose a route around the fallen branches. Then a small light appeared upstairs. Mr Reed was there with his dog. Maya waited while the crew brought them to dry ground. Her notebook now contained something better than a guess: a confirmed rescue.",
      "kind": "section",
      "bytes": 406717,
      "sha256": "89b2f8af60d6fe53fe4d61ed241c6ba31c4c8d7d1bd4c128afdb2342b356f8ad"
    },
