      "bytes": 53959,
      "sha256": "1b800326ccf8712976217d3d522304cce2b5974b349af9521ab7e267e1ec42c0"
    },
    {
      "id": "page-05",
      "file": "page-05.mp3",
      "text": "The shelter was busy but welcoming. A parent pointed to a pile of blankets and held out her hands. Her family was cold after the journey. Mr Reed sat nearby with his dog and a cup of tea. Outside, Maya interviewed a rescue official. She wanted details of the damage, not rumours. 'Which homes are affected?' she said. The official explained what the crew had checked and what was still unknown.",
      "kind": "section",
      "bytes": 397940,
      "sha256": "61906ca72216d02497f57be1805e642c44384091291b698a3c2a4bf2dd12b785"
    },
