      "sha256": "1491f714428282d3d5fb880eefe13f8a7161847cb177646b94304404133f6eab"
    },
    {
      "id": "page-06",
      "file": "page-06.mp3",
      "text": "By lunchtime, Maya was ready for her first broadcast. She stood on dry ground with the camera crew. She described the flood and explained how Mr Reed had reached safety. Meanwhile, new volunteers arrived at the shelter. They went straight to the coordinator, who gave them their duties. One would organise food; another would prepare beds. Maya realised that behind every headline there were people doing patient, practical work.",
      "kind": "section",
      "bytes": 414240,
      "sha256": "e1cb3d2056ed531bd60557a000d83d68cf5b33d7ebc29dff9a64c0a5d7d0aecf"
    },
