    {
      "id": "answer-report-on",
      "file": "answer-report-on.mp3",
      "text": "During her live broadcast, Maya reported on the flood.",
      "kind": "model",
      "bytes": 56049,
      "sha256": "96f520b3639428e2642b3224ddb6cfc7d594946623ef01e88d21e3d0c7ad03b3"
    },
    {
      "id": "answer-report-to",
      "file": "answer-report-to.mp3",
      "text": "On arrival, the volunteers reported to the shelter coordinator for instructions.",
      "kind": "model",
      "bytes": 76111,
      "sha256": "c3cdd3d8837eb534f628311cb80634dffe48dca2575d57449dbc245c687cf42e"
    },
    {
      "id": "page-07",
      "file": "page-07.mp3",
      "text": "The sky darkened again. On television, a weather presenter explained that another storm was approaching. Near the shelter, a pedestrian tried to take a shortcut through a flooded street. A firefighter raised his hand and stopped her at the barrier. She returned to the dry path. Maya included the official warning in her next update. A dramatic picture was useful, but clear information could help someone make a safer decision.",
      "kind": "section",
      "bytes": 402955,
      "sha256": "c45d60e5c2acdaa60d4d3d2436b3650a60665bd0fc4d43953489fc781534d704"
    },
    {
      "id": "prediction-07",
      "file": "prediction-07.mp3",
