      "id": "page-08",
      "file": "page-08.mp3",
      "text": "Inside the shelter, a nurse gently wrapped a bandage around a man's injured arm. Nearby, residents gathered around Elena as she showed a photograph of her damaged home. They listened patiently and discussed what her family would need in the coming weeks. Mr Reed's dog slept under a chair. Maya put down her microphone for a moment. The story was no longer only about water and broken buildings. It was about people who mattered to one another.",
      "kind": "section",
      "bytes": 439318,
      "sha256": "528b6df5a1a0ba881f6cc51937a2a6949b48594c4c7995fc91664c99ee1c2000"
    },
    {
      "id": "prediction-08",
      "file": "prediction-08.mp3",
      "text": "What support might families need after the immediate emergency has ended?",
