    {
      "id": "answer-complain-to",
      "file": "answer-complain-to.mp3",
      "text": "To present the residents’ grievance, Elena complained to the mayor.",
      "kind": "model",
      "bytes": 63572,
      "sha256": "8bff0c81929f82d2670d52afa86ffeb498e59aa85233b4d344ec2c361a79f61a"
    },
    {
      "id": "page-10",
      "file": "page-10.mp3",
      "text": "A week later, clean water deliveries had reached the neighbourhood, and Maya checked the delivery records before sharing the update. At the community centre, students explored how rivers overflow. In another room, emergency planners reviewed photographs of crowded routes and shelters from the previous evacuation. They discussed what to improve. Mr Reed arrived with his dog and thanked the rescue crew. Maya closed her notebook. Her first assignment had taught her that a good report follows the story beyond the headline.",
      "kind": "section",
      "bytes": 489055,
      "sha256": "ca1301746d7cf66c99eb2c096bd1f9f33012a94c33df6b7fd3fa028333953135"
    },
    {
      "id": "prediction-10",
      "file": "prediction-10.mp3",
